The head unit shall perform the following car-to-infrastructure application functions:
1) send vehicle position updates to the OEMVB at the OEM-specified interval, expressed in minutes or meters, for use in addressing relevant vehicles;
2) collect the OEM-specified vehicle-network data items and pre-process them using the algorithms provided by the OEM;
3) send the pre-processed data to the OEMVB at the OEM-specified interval;
4) receive dangerous-spot notifications;
5) check each received dangerous-spot notification for relevance to the driver using the OEM-specified relevance criteria and map-match the spot using the OEM-specified map-matching rules;
6) present relevant notifications to the driver on the head-unit HMI and the instrument cluster using the OEM-specified presentation format.
